# Prettier does not read .gitignore, so generated and vendored trees are listed
# here explicitly. Everything below is excluded for a reason, not by default.

# Build output and generated artifacts.
.next
.source
public/r
test-results
playwright-report
coverage
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Shipped to consumers verbatim. `payload-components add` copies these files
# straight into a user's project, so their formatting is part of the product
# surface rather than an internal style choice — and the registry JSON that
# embeds them is built from these exact bytes. Reformatting the tree is a
# deliberate product decision, not a side effect of adopting a formatter.
payload-components

# Docs and MDX content. Fumadocs serialises MDX to the /llms.txt and geo
# surfaces, and tests/e2e/geo.e2e.spec.ts pins exact substrings from them, so
# reflowing prose here can fail the gate for purely cosmetic reasons.
content
*.mdx

# Playwright's committed PNG baselines.
**/*-snapshots
